flowchart LR
  IM["Authorized Lark group<br/>verified mention / opted-in ordinary text"] --> Provider["dsh-im public Service<br/>exclusive Consumer"]
  Provider --> Commit["Messaging transaction<br/>canonical Source Event"]
  Commit --> Placement["One existing Group Channel placement"]
  Commit --> Admission["Direct @: receiving Bot Admission"]
  Placement --> Members["Current Human and Bot members<br/>native timeline and bounded reads"]
  Commit --> Ordinary["Ordinary text: active member Admissions<br/>own Channel / Bot policy snapshots"]
  Admission --> Runtime["Existing harvest / steer"]
  Ordinary --> Harvest["Per-member count / time harvest<br/>safe turn queue and bounded catch-up"]
  Harvest --> Runtime
  Runtime --> Reply["Explicit own-identity reply<br/>current grant and source checks"]
  Reply --> Outbox["Existing durable Outbox"]
  Outbox --> Provider
  Provider --> IM
